$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of Sugar-Based Enones and Their Transformation into
3,5-Disubstituted Furans and 2-Acyl-Substituted 1,2,3-Trideoxy Sugars in
the Presence of Lewis Acids
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
